L1: Exercise May Ameliorate the Detrimental Side Effects of High Vitamin D Supplementation on Muscle Function in Mice
L2: Journal of Bone and Mineral Research (2020)
L3: Danielle A Debruin, Cara A Timpani, Hannah Lalunio, Emma Rybalka, Craig A Goodman, Alan Hayes
